; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on XAUUSD - trailing result M10 + Percent trailing, setup 4 of 4: sell, session AllDay server time, trend filter H1 EMA 200, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON BTC.
; Trailing: 0.2% of price behind the best price once the profit reaches 0.2%, stop moved once per closed minute. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 2, TrailParam 0).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only (score 1.30): 86 trades, PF 1.81.
; UNSEEN May 16 - Nov 13 2026: this setup 68 trades, PF 1.63, net +10.6R; the 4 setups of this combination together 181 trades, PF 1.31 (stressed 1.25).
; EARLIER DATA, before the calibration period: Jul-Dec 2024: this setup 38 trades, PF 0.58. The combination together: Jul-Dec 2024 PF 0.74 (137 trades). The 2026 result did NOT hold on earlier data: UNPROVEN, demo and Strategy Tester only.
; Data: FTMO XAUUSD M1 to May 15 2026, Dukascopy after; FTMO spread table; no commission in the test (VT: set CommissionPerLot).
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter was not in the backtest.
